{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18080","headline":"食曲河驿 · 韩愈","name":"食曲河驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨及曲河驿，凄然自伤情。\n羣乌巢庭树，乳燕飞檐楹。\n而我抱重罪，孑孑万里程。\n亲戚顿乖角，图史弃纵横。\n下负明义重，上孤朝命荣。\n杀身谅无补，何用答生成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}